          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.12.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luka 12:35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu waamba, “Wakati mimi, Mutu Yela Mlunguni, ndiphouya kutawala ufalume ambao Mlungu wanipha, undaelezwa na ndarira hino. Siku mwenga, vyandama kumi ahala taa zao, achendamchinjira bwana arusi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kahi-kahi yao, atsano akala azuzu na atsano achikala alachu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana hara vyandama azuzu ahala taa zao, ela taayatsukula mafuha, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ela hara alachu atsukula taa zao na tupa za mafuha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa vira bwana arusi wachelewa kpwedza, hara vyandama asenukira na achilala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ela usiku wa manane kpwakala na hoyo rosikirwa kuamba, ‘Hiye bwana arusi aredza; phiyani mkamchinjire.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi hara vyandama kumi alamuka achitayarisha taa zao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao hara azuzu achiaambira hara alachu, ‘Hupheni mafuha genu sababu taa zehu zinafwa.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela hara alachu achiaambira, ‘Hata! Tagandatosha swiswi na mwimwi; ni baha mphiye dukani mkagule genu.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Phahi hara vyandama azuzu ariphouka kpwendagula mafuha, bwana arusi wakpwedza. Hara ambao kala a tayari ainjira phamwenga naye dzumba ra arusi, chisha mryango uchifungbwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.13.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luka 13:25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Badaye hara vyandama anjina piya auya achedzaamba, ‘Bwana, bwana, huvugurire!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela naye achiaamba, ‘Nakuambirani kpweli kukala sikumanyani.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chimarigizo Jesu waamba, “Kpwa hivyo chesani, mana tammanya mambo gaga gandahendeka siku iphi na saa ngaphi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.19.11+LUK.19.12+LUK.19.13+LUK.19.14+LUK.19.15+LUK.19.16+LUK.19.17+LUK.19.18+LUK.19.19+LUK.19.20+LUK.19.21+LUK.19.22+LUK.19.23+LUK.19.24+LUK.19.25+LUK.19.26+LUK.19.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luka 19:11–27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu achienderera kugomba, achiamba, “Kuuya kpwangu kundakala dza hivi. Mutu mmwenga wapanga kuphiya charo. Phahi waiha atumishie achiapha madaraka ga kuimirira malize, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naye achimupha chila mmwenga kulengana na uwezowe. Mmwenga wamupha mifuko mitsano ya zahabu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25:15",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Chiyunani talanta mwenga ni sawa na kilo 34 za zahabu, au mshahara wa miaka kumi na mitsano wa muhendadzi-kazi.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " wanjina achimupha mifuko miiri ya zahabu, wanjina achimupha mfuko mmwenga wa zahabu. Chisha achiphiya charoche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mara mwenga yuya yephokera mifuko mitsano waandza bishara nayo, naye achiphaha mifuko mitsano zaidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vivyo hivyo yuya wa mifuko miiri waphaha fwaida ya mifuko miiri zaidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela yuya ariyehewa mfuko mmwenga wakpwendatsimba dibwa, achiufwitsa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Bada ya muda mure, yuya bwana wauya, achedzahenda isabu phamwenga na atumishie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi yuya kala akaphaha mifuko mitsano ya zahabu wakpwedza kuno akatsukula mifuko mitsano zaidi, achiamba, ‘Bwana, wanipha mifuko mitsano ya zahabu, ela nkakurehera mifuko mitsano zaidi, ndiyo fwaida nriyophaha.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yuya bwana achimuamba, ‘Wahendato! U mtumishi mnono tsona muaminifu. Kpwa sababu wakala muaminifu wa mambo madide, nindakupha garigo makulu. Ndzo husherekee phamwenga.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Naye yuya yehewa mifuko miiri piya wakpwedza, achiamba, ‘Bwana, wanipha mifuko miiri ya zahabu vino hala mifuko miiri zaidi ndiyo fwaida nriyophaha.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 25:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yuya mutu achimuamba, ‘Wahendato! U mtumishi mnono tsona muaminifu. Kpwa sababu wakala muaminifu wa mambo madide, nindakupha garigo makulu. Ndzo husherekee phamwenga.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.25.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.25.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
